# APEX — redirects (Cloudflare Pages)
#
# Two jobs:  1) legacy vanity URLs  2) .html -> clean canonical URL
#
# Every destination is a final 200 URL. No rule points at another rule, so no
# request ever takes more than one hop. Destinations carry NO trailing slash:
# Cloudflare Pages 308s /foo.html to /foo for leaf pages, so a stale
# trailing slash here would silently turn one hop into two — EXCEPT for the
# three directory index pages (/it/, /answers/, /it/risposte/), where Pages
# canonicalises the other way and the slash is required.

# --- legacy vanity URLs ---
/how-it-works.html                                      /product                                          301
/how-it-works                                           /product                                          301
/it/come-funziona.html                                  /it/prodotto                                      301
/it/come-funziona                                       /it/prodotto                                      301
/for-riders.html                                        /pricing                                          301
/for-riders                                             /pricing                                          301
/it/per-i-piloti.html                                   /it/prezzi                                        301
/it/per-i-piloti                                        /it/prezzi                                        301
/contact                                                /beta                                             301
/it/contatti                                            /it/beta                                          301

# --- dead paths Canopy caught looping (/login.html <-> /login) ---
/login.html                                             /beta                                             301
/login                                                  /beta                                             301
/it/login.html                                          /it/beta                                          301
/it/login                                               /it/beta                                          301

